        "TileImage": "$($repository 689f0c72-34eb-4f30-ae33-33a5791bd3f6).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Today you return to the Himmapa Hotel in Bangkok, where a somewhat strange mission awaits you. One of the hotel managers does not like an employee named Willy Ponhpaiboon. So he is tonight&apos;s target because our client does not like how much he makes compared to the fact that he is just a gardener. The client also claims that he has seen him teasing and shouting at customers. The client also asked and paid separately for you not to make a big fuss at the hotel, so check the rules.",
